OL,3,CWatch live: Aerial footage of major
OL,4,Cwildfire on Suffolk coast
OL,6,FWatch live footage of a major wildfire
OL,7,Ftearing through the Suffolk coast
OL,8,Fafter a blaze broke out at Dunwich
OL,9,FHeath near Leiston.
OL,11,FThe fire started shortly after 5.30pm
OL,12,Fon Wednesday and spread rapidly in a
OL,13,Fsouth-westerly direction towards St
OL,14,FJames's Church off Westleton Road.
OL,16,FProperties in the area have been
OL,17,Fevacuated as a precaution.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/2
